{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"For a stable flow in a chamber, the voltage flow rate Q is equal to the average velocity v of the constructed chamber section A: Q = A × v. To save time for filling, you can divide the volume of the chamber by the flow rate. Real systems can vary in depth, thickness, faces, drainage characteristics and variable levels.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"flow-rate-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"am","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"flow-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["flow-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"am","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"በክፍል ውስጥ ለተረጋጋ ዝውውር ፣ የቮልቴጅ ዝውውር ፍጥነት Q በአማካይ ፍጥነት v የተገነባው የክፍል ክፍል A ጋር እኩል ነው: Q = A × v. ለመሙላት ጊዜ ለማስቀመጥ ፣ የከርሰ ምድር መጠንን በዝውውር ፍጥነት መክፈል ይችላሉ። እውነተኛ ስርዓቶች በድብቅ ፣ በፍራሽ ፣ በፊቶች ፣ በፍሳሽ ባህሪያት እና በሚለዋወጡ ደረጃዎች ሊለወጡ ይችላሉ።","record_id":"3603ffffaaca79172414171fe651b085163feb93dbc32caf1aa42f551c34b135","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.069105262624987,"source":"For steady flow through a section, volumetric flow rate Q equals cross-sectional area A multiplied by average velocity v: Q = A × v. To estimate filling time, divide container volume by flow rate. Real systems can vary with pressure, friction, fittings, fluid properties and changing levels.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"1f3f4899f63ab5cc3e1f65d9265252070b9fa68d439aaa24dc4a03795f9b489f","status":"machine-draft","translation":"በክፍል ውስጥ ለተረጋጋ ዝውውር ፣ የቮልቴጅ ዝውውር ፍጥነት Q በአማካይ ፍጥነት v የተገነባው የክፍል ክፍል A ጋር እኩል ነው: Q = A × v. ለመሙላት ጊዜ ለማስቀመጥ ፣ የከርሰ ምድር መጠንን በዝውውር ፍጥነት መክፈል ይችላሉ። እውነተኛ ስርዓቶች በድብቅ ፣ በፍራሽ ፣ በፊቶች ፣ በፍሳሽ ባህሪያት እና በሚለዋወጡ ደረጃዎች ሊለወጡ ይችላሉ።","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
